- New head: `this.peek()`; old head: `\old(this.peek())`
- "greater than or equal to according to the queue's ordering" → compare using the natural ordering: `compareTo(...) >= 0`

<code>assert this.size() > 0 => ((Comparable)this.peek()).compareTo(\old(this.peek())) >= 0;</code>
